{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261016/photo/bkn-20261016210016441-1016_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261016232156\"/><p>今日(16日)下午4時09分，執法部門接獲市民報案，指其住在荃灣河背街的41歲女親友於家中睡房暈倒。救護員隨即上門救援，並將事主送往仁濟醫院搶救，可惜她其後被證實死亡。案件列作「送院時死亡」，事主的死因有待驗屍後確定。據了解，女事主為印尼裔，持香港身份證。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T15:40:14.668681+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T13:00:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T15:57:51.460703+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T15:37:52.810521+00:00","content_hash":"6d7d33d4da4b340a3617673094931cea27caa707279c525679e9fb082a3c75e3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}